~ main

if Global.talked_with_zombie == false:
	if true:
		Zombie: Wait...
		Zombie: You are going deeper into the jungle, aren't you?

		Player: Yes.
		Player: I'm looking for my cow.

		Zombie: Then you need to know the truth about this place.

		Player: What truth?

		Zombie: The deeper you go into the jungle...
		Zombie: The more dangerous it becomes.

		Player: What is waiting for me?

		Zombie: The One-Eyed Demon has an army hidden deep within the jungle.
		Zombie: They are not like the monsters you have fought before.
		Zombie: They are his strongest soldiers.

		Player: How many of them are there?

		Zombie: I don't know.
		Zombie: I stopped counting a long time ago.
		Zombie: Every time one of them falls...
		Zombie: Another monster takes its place.

		Player: Then I'll defeat them all.

		Zombie: You are brave.
		Zombie: But bravery alone won't be enough.

		Player: What should I do?

		Zombie: Keep moving deeper into the jungle.
		Zombie: Fight every monster that stands in your way.
		Zombie: Search the ruins, caves, and forgotten paths.
		Zombie: The Demon has hidden his power throughout this place.

		- What will I find in the deep jungle?
			Zombie: Ancient ruins...
			Zombie: Dangerous monsters...
			Zombie: And secrets the Demon doesn't want you to discover.
			=> warning

		- Why is the Demon hiding his army here?
			Zombie: He is protecting the path to his fortress.
			Zombie: He knows someone is coming for him.
			Zombie: And he will do everything he can to stop you.
			=> warning

		- What should I be afraid of?
			Zombie: The monsters are not your greatest danger.
			Zombie: The deeper you go...
			Zombie: The more the Demon will notice you.
			Zombie: When he realizes what you are trying to do...
			Zombie: He will send his strongest army after you.
			=> warning


	~ warning

	Player: And what about my cow?

	Zombie: She is still beyond the Red Gate.
	Zombie: The Demon took her there for a reason.

	Player: What reason?

	Zombie: I don't know.
	Zombie: But I know this...
	Zombie: He would not keep her alive without a purpose.

	Player: Then I have to reach the Red Gate.

	Zombie: Yes.
	Zombie: But the path to the Red Gate is protected by the Demon's army.

	Player: I'll make my way through them.

	Zombie: Then don't turn back.
	Zombie: Keep going deeper.
	Zombie: The jungle will become darker...
	Zombie: The monsters will become stronger...
	Zombie: But eventually, you will reach the Red Gate.

	Player: And beyond it?

	Zombie: The One-Eyed Demon.
	Zombie: His fortress.
	Zombie: And your cow.

	Player: I'll rescue her.

	Zombie: I hope you do.
	Zombie: Because if anyone can defeat that monster...
	Zombie: It might be you.

	Player: Why are you helping me?

	Zombie: Because the One-Eyed Demon betrayed me.
	Zombie: He turned me into this creature.
	Zombie: I cannot forgive him.

	Player: Then we have the same enemy.

	Zombie: Exactly.
	Zombie: Go into the jungle.
	Zombie: Become stronger.
	Zombie: Fight his army.
	Zombie: And when you finally reach the Red Gate...

	Zombie: Kill the One-Eyed Demon.

	Player: I will.

	Zombie: Then go.
	Zombie: Your journey is only beginning.

	set Global.talked_with_zombie = true
	=> END


if Global.talked_with_zombie == true:

